# Settings > System > On-screen keyboard on the PDA profile (report 042): Handwriting + keyboard (the profile's
# default, nothing stored) puts the writing zone's band first: the Keyboard test's Text field shows it (vkb=zone); the
# strip's Keyb puts the standard keyboard in its place, with the close cross at the right of its top row (vkb=auto),
# and it stays for the next field (Tab: the Number field's number pad, the cross still there); the cross brings the
# band back. The choice list has the three values of this profile (Auto, On, Handwriting + keyboard; two elsewhere,
# pda_title_osk_choice). On: the standard keyboard only (no band, no cross), shown even with a physical keyboard
# (vkb=force). Auto: the standard keyboard as on every board (no band): hidden with a physical keyboard, shown when it
# goes. Goldens at both sizes.
title zone keyboard
sizes 480x640 480x800
profile pda
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 1
keyboards 0
apps Settings Store CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
expect_mode 3
launch Settings
# System (the last section); from its end: Shutdown, Reboot, Keyboard test, Strokes training, On-screen keyboard
key UP
key ENTER
key UP
key UP
key UP
key ENTER
expect_zone shown
expect_osk hidden
expect_vkb zone
zonekey Keyb
expect_zone hidden
expect_osk shown
expect_vkb auto
tapkey h
tapkey i
expect_text hi
shot zone_keyb_text
tapkey Tab
expect_osk shown
expect_zone hidden
shot zone_keyb_numpad
tapkey CLOSE
expect_osk hidden
expect_zone shown
expect_vkb zone
shot zone_keyb_back
# Esc stops editing, Esc again leaves the form; Up twice: On-screen keyboard
key ESC
key ESC
expect_zone hidden
key UP
key UP
key ENTER
wait 300
shot zone_osk_choice
header zone_osk_choice "On-screen keyboard"
expect_text Auto
expect_text On
expect_text "Handwriting + keyboard"
# the list opens on the current value (Handwriting + keyboard, the last row): Up is On
key UP
key ENTER
expect_mode 2
key DOWN
key DOWN
key ENTER
expect_zone hidden
expect_osk shown
expect_vkb force
shot zone_osk_on
keyboards 1
wait 400
expect_osk shown
expect_zone hidden
key ESC
key ESC
key UP
key UP
key ENTER
wait 300
# On is the current row: Up is Auto
key UP
key ENTER
expect_mode 0
key DOWN
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 400
expect_osk hidden
expect_zone hidden
expect_vkb auto
keyboards 0
wait 400
expect_osk shown
expect_zone hidden
shot zone_osk_auto
